		(property "Note" "Gate to ground. Carries (73.3 - 12) / 47k = 1.3 mA through pulse 2a, 32 uA at 13.5 V. With Ciss it also sets the turn-off time when the load side is pulled to zero -- tens of microseconds, which is why the negative clamp is sized for this FET staying ON through a whole pulse."
