		(property "Chosen" "Chemi-Con HXC hybrid polymer, 82 uF, 80 V, 10 x 12.5 mm, 28 mOhm max, Z(-55)/Z(20) <= 2 at 100 kHz, 2.1 A rms at 125 C, 4000 h at 125 C, AEC-Q200. Two in series: 41 uF, 160 V"
