				)
			)
		)
		(property "Why two" "No capacitor rated above 100 V publishes a cold ESR. These do: 28 mOhm max, at most 2x at -55 C. Stack worst 224 mOhm aged and cold -- 18 A in 45 us, against 38 us nominal."
